        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tony Donnelly of LWK is delighted to present this stunning family home.\r\n\r\nThis magnificent A rated four bedroom c.194.04 sq mts Country residence set back from the road on c.2.4 acres of stud railed paddocks, accessed through a recessed entrance with electronic gates and gravel drive with bollard lighting.\r\n\r\nDownstairs has very extensive living accommodation with underfloor heating, comprising of open plan kitchen/dining area with French double doors leading a south west facing patio area.\r\n\r\nVery spacious separate sitting/living room with sliding double doors leading to back garden, double bedroom, home office, utility room and guest w/c complete downstairs.\r\nUpstairs has a beautiful bright and spacious landing with raised ceiling three double bedroom’s, master with en-suite, walk in wardrobe and balcony overlooking beautiful countryside. The stunning family bathroom and plant room completes upstairs.\r\n\r\nThis property is finished to an exceptional high standard and needs to be seen to be believed, it will make an ideal family home for any purchaser.\r\nLocated just off the R401 Kildare to Rathangan road and within easy access to Kildare town centre, primary/secondary schools and all local amenities and short drive to the to the world famous Curragh plains/ racecourse & the  M7 motorway at Kildare village junction 13.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
